 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.6.0-rc19 — Themes: client + chatbox
+
+- **Client themes** (System → Appearance): UnderWeb Green (default), Blood Moon, Violet, Ice, Gold, Rose, Mono, or any custom color. One accent recolors the whole client — UnderWeb pages, premium cards, and VRCX's own buttons, highlights and sidebar — with readable button text on any color. Optional background tint (none / subtle / strong). Turn it off to use VRCX's own theme. Saved on this PC and painted at startup with no flash.
+- **Green theme pass**: every UnderWeb screen now uses the theme accent instead of hard-coded colors (previously a mix of green and violet). "Allowed / OK" messages stay green, and instance-invite blue, danger red etc. keep their meaning.
+- **Chatbox themes** (OSC Lab): Clean, Neon, Boxed, Minimal, Event and UnderWeb, each with a live mini preview. One click swaps all module layouts plus an optional top/bottom line; your modules, statuses and switches stay. Save your own looks. Top/bottom lines only show when something else is showing, and are dropped first if the 144-character limit is tight.
+
 ## 0.5.9-rc18 — Member view vs staff view
 
 UWX now shows each person what they can actually use, based only on what the servers say:
